          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:3cf6f6f3591cf3f6436cd4639c9d2596ee99709b516ef169a91252f1dff40d0f"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3715d2e32caf47d2adbfc6b2476abd53",
      "statement": "The extension is reactive and user-controlled: the user explicitly starts/stops the bridge, browser state is available only while the extension is connected, every read/action is an explicit MCP request, and continuous streaming/surveillance/session-cloning are explicitly prohibited.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://AGENTS.md#L38-L59",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5108fa23a0704a925607058fa4efeac64680aab8e7afcdbb38cc529e2b919c32:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4b8268227f194805aef2fccb36b486b3",
      "statement": "packages/shared is the single source of truth for the protocol and browser-agnostic logic (protocol envelopes, page-context/page-content DOM extraction, background-controller, content-handler, page-reader, logger) used by both extensions and server-side code; protocol shapes must not be duplicated elsewhere.",
