    {
      "id": "claim_5ec16f3b9d6d436182e7abb8cffb1460",
      "statement": "The MCP HTTP server requires a Bearer MCP_HTTP_AUTH_TOKEN (startup throws if empty), validates Origin against MCP_HTTP_ALLOWED_ORIGINS (exact or *. wildcard host) before tool handling returning 403 on mismatch, gates the configured path and only GET/POST/DELETE methods, and returns 401 for missing/invalid bearer tokens before any MCP handling. The MCP HTTP token is separate from the WebSocket pairing token.",
