    {
      "id": "claim_0599a6ab8bd143a08e0d81243f9f2875",
      "statement": "The MCP HTTP server exposes GET /health returning status ok, version, uptime, and the configured WebSocket URL with status unknown; BRIJIO_MCP_HTTP_TIMEOUT_MS (default 60000) sets server/request timeouts and derives the approval timeout as httpTimeoutMs minus BRIJIO_APPROVAL_TIMEOUT_BUFFER_MS (default 5000) floored at 1000. Defaults: host 0.0.0.0, port 8788, path /mcp.",
