      "id": "claim_d179f55c666445bd9b354bcd225ff1a8",
      "statement": "Tab targeting (ADR 0060/0062) is per-call and stateless: an optional tabId flows MCP tool input -> relay envelope target -> extension chrome.tabs.sendMessage(tabId,...)/tabs.update(tabId,...), with a documented active-tab fallback when tabId is absent; there is no hidden selected-tab session state, and tab list is fetched on demand via an explicit list_tabs tool rather than streamed.",
