      "id": "claim_f91bd952515d4c40bc82ad68980777d0",
      "statement": "Two distinct tokens govern the chain: the MCP HTTP bearer token (MCP_HTTP_AUTH_TOKEN) authenticates the agent-to-MCP-server HTTP boundary, and the pairing token (BRIJIO_PAIRING_TOKEN) authenticates both the MCP-server-to-relay and extension-to-relay WebSocket connections and defines the shared private routing scope.",
